   570	
   571	// ---------------------------------------------------------------- bio (S2b)
   572	
   573	/// A line about oneself on one's page: 40 letters, approved before others see
   574	/// it, shown to oneself at once (a refusal says nothing). No links or ways to
   575	/// reach someone off Koco (user 11/25): addresses, handles, numbers, the apps'
   576	/// names people use to pass them on.
   577	const BIO_MAX = 40;
   578	function offKoco(text) {
